    "section_Jj8h37": {
      "type": "section",
      "blocks": {
        "text_9x8wNk": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Before you choose</h2>",
            "width": "fit-content",
            "max_width": "none",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "custom",
            "font": "var(--font-heading--family)",
            "font_size": "1.125rem",
            "line_height": "normal",
            "letter_spacing": "normal",
            "case": "uppercase",
            "wrap": "pretty",
            "text_color": "",
            "background": false,
            "background_color": "#00000026",
            "corner_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 20,
            "padding-inline-end": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "accordion_DWEtAW": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "name": "t:names.accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "caret",
            "dividers": true,
            "divider_color": "#dedede",
            "type_preset": "paragraph",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": "",
            "border": "none",
            "border_width": 1,
            "border_opacity": 100,
            "border_color": "",
            "border_radius": 25,
            "padding-block-start": 20,
            "padding-block-end": 20,
            "padding-inline-start": 20,
            "padding-inline-end": 20
          },
          "blocks": {
            "accordion_row_4KwJDx": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Are these real professional products?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "question_mark",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_WnxDja": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes. Same formulas and same formats as professional distribution, imported directly from the manufacturers. No lighter versions for the online channel, no stock of uncertain origin.</p><p>Technical lines such as bleaches and developers remain reserved for verified PRO accounts.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_WnxDja"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_MwhWKD": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How much product do I actually need?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "question_mark",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_K3zyCt": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>These are concentrated formulas: the correct dose is almost always smaller than the one used out of habit.</p><p>Every product page shows volume, dose per application and frequency. For technical treatments you also find the mixing ratio and processing times, so you can work out the cost per service before ordering.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_K3zyCt"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_eynTL9": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How do I choose between two similar products?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "question_mark",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_48XCDN": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Look at the problem, not the name. Two products from the same line can work on different mechanisms: one seals the cuticle, the other rebuilds the fibre.</p><p>clichAIr reads the INCI and tells you which of the two fits the specific case, in what order and how often. On request it also calculates the cost per application.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_48XCDN"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_mVEjNh": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Where do these products come from?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "question_mark",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_Jz3t8k": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>We import directly from the manufacturers and hold stock in Switzerland. No parallel market, no goods of uncertain origin.</p><p>It is also why the catalogue is concentrating on fewer brands: following a few producers directly is worth more than reselling many.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_Jz3t8k"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_XUkMeq": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Professional prices and PRO account",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "question_mark",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "liquid_pro_XUkMeq": {
                  "type": "custom-liquid",
                  "name": "t:names.custom_liquid",
                  "settings": {
                    "custom_liquid": "{% case request.locale.iso_code %}\n{% when 'it' %}\n{% assign cl_pro = \"<p>Il tuo account professionale &egrave; attivo: i prezzi in questa pagina sono i tuoi prezzi netti, IVA esclusa. Vedi anche i formati professionali e le linee tecniche riservate.</p><p>Nessun ordine minimo, pagamento a 30 giorni. Per aggiungere una sede o rivedere le condizioni, scrivici.</p>\" %}\n{% assign cl_priv = \"<p>Stai vedendo i prezzi per i clienti privati, IVA inclusa. Se lavori in un salone, in un'accademia o come distributore, l'account PRO apre su questa stessa pagina i prezzi netti IVA esclusa, i formati professionali e le linee tecniche riservate.</p><p>Nessun ordine minimo, nessun contratto, pagamento a 30 giorni. Verifica in 1-24 ore lavorative.</p><p><a href='/it/pages/professionals'>Vedi le condizioni professionali</a></p>\" %}\n{% assign cl_anon = \"<p>I prezzi che vedi ora sono quelli per i clienti privati, IVA inclusa. Con un account PRO verificato, questa stessa pagina mostra i prezzi netti IVA esclusa, i formati professionali e le linee tecniche riservate.</p><p>Nessun ordine minimo, nessun contratto, pagamento a 30 giorni. Attivazione gratuita, verifica in 1-24 ore lavorative.</p><p>Le condizioni sono diverse per saloni, accademie e distributori.<br><a href='/it/pages/professionals'>Vedi le condizioni professionali</a></p>\" %}\n{% when 'de' %}\n{% assign cl_pro = \"<p>Ihr Profikonto ist aktiv: Die Preise auf dieser Seite sind Ihre Nettopreise, ohne MwSt. Sie sehen auch die professionellen Formate und die reservierten technischen Linien.</p><p>Keine Mindestbestellung, Zahlung in 30 Tagen. Um einen Standort hinzuzuf&uuml;gen oder die Konditionen anzupassen, schreiben Sie uns.</p>\" %}\n{% assign cl_priv = \"<p>Sie sehen die Preise f&uuml;r Privatkunden, inkl. MwSt. Wenn Sie in einem Coiffeursalon, einer Akademie oder als Distributor arbeiten, &ouml;ffnet ein PRO-Konto auf derselben Seite die Nettopreise ohne MwSt, die professionellen Formate und die reservierten technischen Linien.</p><p>Keine Mindestbestellung, kein Vertrag, Zahlung in 30 Tagen. Pr&uuml;fung innerhalb von 1 bis 24 Arbeitsstunden.</p><p><a href='/de/pages/professionals'>Profikonditionen ansehen</a></p>\" %}\n{% assign cl_anon = \"<p>Die Preise, die Sie jetzt sehen, gelten f&uuml;r Privatkunden, inkl. MwSt. Mit einem verifizierten PRO-Konto zeigt dieselbe Seite die Nettopreise ohne MwSt, die professionellen Formate und die reservierten technischen Linien.</p><p>Keine Mindestbestellung, kein Vertrag, Zahlung in 30 Tagen. Kostenlose Aktivierung, Pr&uuml;fung innerhalb von 1 bis 24 Arbeitsstunden.</p><p>Die Konditionen unterscheiden sich f&uuml;r Coiffeursalons, Akademien und Distributoren.<br><a href='/de/pages/professionals'>Profikonditionen ansehen</a></p>\" %}\n{% when 'fr' %}\n{% assign cl_pro = \"<p>Votre compte professionnel est actif : les prix de cette page sont vos prix nets, hors TVA. Vous voyez aussi les formats professionnels et les lignes techniques r&eacute;serv&eacute;es.</p><p>Aucune commande minimum, paiement &agrave; 30 jours. Pour ajouter un site ou revoir vos conditions, &eacute;crivez-nous.</p>\" %}\n{% assign cl_priv = \"<p>Vous voyez les prix pour les clients priv&eacute;s, TVA incluse. Si vous travaillez dans un salon, une acad&eacute;mie ou comme distributeur, un compte PRO ouvre sur cette m&ecirc;me page les prix nets hors TVA, les formats professionnels et les lignes techniques r&eacute;serv&eacute;es.</p><p>Aucune commande minimum, aucun contrat, paiement &agrave; 30 jours. V&eacute;rification sous 1 &agrave; 24 heures ouvrables.</p><p><a href='/fr/pages/professionals'>Voir les conditions professionnelles</a></p>\" %}\n{% assign cl_anon = \"<p>Les prix affich&eacute;s sont ceux des clients priv&eacute;s, TVA incluse. Avec un compte PRO v&eacute;rifi&eacute;, cette m&ecirc;me page affiche les prix nets hors TVA, les formats professionnels et les lignes techniques r&eacute;serv&eacute;es.</p><p>Aucune commande minimum, aucun contrat, paiement &agrave; 30 jours. Activation gratuite, v&eacute;rification sous 1 &agrave; 24 heures ouvrables.</p><p>Les conditions diff&egrave;rent pour les salons, les acad&eacute;mies et les distributeurs.<br><a href='/fr/pages/professionals'>Voir les conditions professionnelles</a></p>\" %}\n{% else %}\n{% assign cl_pro = \"<p>Your professional account is active: the prices on this page are your net prices, VAT excluded. You also see professional formats and reserved technical lines.</p><p>No minimum order, payment in 30 days. To add a location or review your conditions, write to us.</p>\" %}\n{% assign cl_priv = \"<p>You are seeing prices for private clients, VAT included. If you work in a salon, an academy or as a distributor, a PRO account opens net prices excluding VAT on this same page, along with professional formats and reserved technical lines.</p><p>No minimum order, no contract, payment in 30 days. Verification within 1 to 24 business hours.</p><p><a href='/pages/professionals'>See professional conditions</a></p>\" %}\n{% assign cl_anon = \"<p>The prices you see now are those for private clients, VAT included. With a verified PRO account, this same page shows net prices excluding VAT, professional formats and reserved technical lines.</p><p>No minimum order, no contract, payment in 30 days. Free activation, verification within 1 to 24 business hours.</p><p>Conditions differ for salons, academies and distributors.<br><a href='/pages/professionals'>See professional conditions</a></p>\" %}\n{% endcase %}\n{% if customer.b2b? %}{{ cl_pro }}{% elsif customer %}{{ cl_priv }}{% else %}{{ cl_anon }}{% endif %}"
